span.p:
Partner team and CI runner
(contract tests through test endpoints;
their tester calls /system/test/*)

REST API + worker
detects breaches and gaps; pre-fills Art. 3(49) fields;
records dispositions and revisions; computes Art. 73 deadlines;
plans and sends 50/80/100% reminders; hash-chained ledger;
assembles and stores reports; records submissions; erases after retain_until;
nightly ledger verification and alerts. Never assigns severity.

Chain-head workflow
(.github/workflows/chain-head.yml, daily 03:17 UTC;
verifies the export against the last head)
